n: 9.5.3
kind: hub
name: review-of-ground-documents
is: All 39 claims of 3.3.kg (20 observations, 19 findings) were read against their sources: 38 confirmed, 1 holds only as amended (3.3.4.7), none disputed, none left unreviewed. The first review amended four nodes (3.3.1.2, 3.3.4.7, 3.3.8.2, 3.3.9.3); after their fix a third reader opened the sources again and confirmed three. The file has no relayed web claim; every primary file was opened at the cited lines, and the earlier axiom text and the pinned seed counts were re-read with git show.
limit: The hubs carry no review. Hub 3.3.4 was edited with the fix and read again: 'grew by a third' holds (34,149 over 25,483 lines), and its last sentence repeats 'The study read three definitions', the wording review 9.5.3.20 amends. The old runtime was not run.
